<li><h3 data-toc-injected="true" style="display:inline; font-size:inherit; font-weight:inherit; font-style:inherit; font-family:inherit; color:inherit; margin:0; padding:0; line-height:inherit;">10 <b>daṇḍakammavatthu</b><b> </b>(basis for penalizations / punishments)
                    </h3><ul>
<li>last 5 precepts
                            <ul>
<li><b>vikālabhojana</b> (eating outside the proper time)</li>
